  "description": "Reid eMetro eBike | Compact Electric City Bike\nThe Reid eMetro eBike is designed for practical, comfortable urban riding, combining a compact frame with reliable electric assistance and everyday functionality.\nPowered by a 250W rear hub motor and a 10.4Ah frame-mounted battery, the eMetro provides electric assistance for city journeys and everyday errands. The Key Display KD58 keeps essential ride information easily accessible while you ride.\nA 7-speed L-TWOO trigger shifter works with the Shimano TY200 rear derailleur and 14–28T Shimano freewheel to provide versatile gearing for urban streets and varied riding conditions.\nTektro HD-M275 hydraulic disc brakes deliver controlled braking, while 20 x 2.125-inch tyres mounted on double-wall rims provide grip and stability. Together, these components make the eMetro a practical choice for navigating busy streets and cycle paths.\nThe Reid eMetro eBike is ideal for:\n\nUrban commuters, with electric assistance for everyday journeys\n\nCity riders, with compact 20-inch wheels for manoeuvrable handling\n\nRiders seeking versatile gearing, with a 7-speed Shimano drivetrain\n\nCyclists prioritising controlled braking, with Tektro hydraulic disc brakes\n\nEveryday leisure riding, with a 250W rear hub motor and 10.4Ah battery\n\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
